{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年84歲的英國殿堂級樂隊披頭四（The Beatles）前成員侏羅麥卡尼（Paul McCartney）出名吸金力驚人，最近國際財經雜誌《福布斯》（Forbes）就公布他的身家已跳升至14億美元（約109.2億港元），成為全球最富有的音樂</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:03:53.562460+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:40:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:57:12.622823+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:57:12.622823+00:00","content_hash":"95389b81236a9e4e17fc426cc1c9c050799b7082b7ebb84cc5b8e6e00d7bf94e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}